# 统一换行符：脚本/源码/文档一律 LF，避免 macOS 下 shebang 变成 CRLF 导致无法执行
* text=auto
*.command text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.js      text eol=lf
*.ts      text eol=lf
*.vue     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf
*.html    text eol=lf

# 二进制资源
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dmg binary
*.zip binary
